  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://v.blakesmods.com/banners/ironjetpacks?source=modrinth\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cucumber\"><img src=\"https://blakesmods.com/img/banner/cucumber_required.png\" alt=\"\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"display: flex;\" align=\"left\"><a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/iron-jetpacks\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/ironjetpacks/downloads&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/iron-jetpacks\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/ironjetpacks/version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/iron-jetpacks\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/ironjetpacks/mc_version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/docs/ironjetpacks\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=docs&amp;message=view&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a href=\"https://blakesmods.com/wiki/ironjetpacks\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=wiki&amp;message=view&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Iron Jetpacks 是一款現代化的噴射背包模組，功能豐富且易於使用。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>功能特色</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">完全可自訂！所有噴射背包的數值與屬性皆可調整，還能自行新增！<a href=\"https://blakesmods.com/docs/ironjetpacks/jetpack-json\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(文件)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">內建多種由原版與模組材料製成的預設噴射背包。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">採用 Forge Energy (FE) 供電，提供廣泛的模組相容性。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">油門控制！隨時調節空中移動速度！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">使用內建 HUD 查看當前能量、引擎、懸浮與油門狀態。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>新功能！</strong>支援 Curios！可將噴射背包裝備為飾品。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/blakesmods\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/fdf1b29a-987b-450e-b6d4-a16c2da8aadf.png\" width=\"1086\" height=\"170\"></strong></a></span></p>",
